WEBVTT

00:05:58.187 --> 00:06:00.648
such as animals and humans.

00:06:00.856 --> 00:06:01.982
And that’s again,

00:06:01.982 --> 00:06:03.401
especially at night,

00:06:03.401 --> 00:06:04.568
super important.

00:06:05.111 --> 00:06:09.865
Now, every one of these sensors
is very powerful by itself,

00:06:09.865 --> 00:06:13.285
but when you put them together
is when the magic happens.

00:06:13.953 --> 00:06:16.247
If you see with this vehicle, for example,

00:06:16.247 --> 00:06:18.958
you have these multiple sensor modalities

00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:21.544
at all top four corners of the vehicle

00:06:21.544 --> 00:06:27.258
that basically provide you
a 360-degree field of vision,

00:06:27.258 --> 00:06:28.467
continuously,

00:06:28.467 --> 00:06:29.760
in a redundant manner,

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.887
so that we don't miss anything.